The plate is a square side plate of roughly 25 cm. The roasted sweet potato pile covers about 9 × 8 cm and is about 3 cm high, so I estimate around 150 g. Next to it are two small round and oval items that look like mushrooms, or possibly small meatballs or dumplings. The larger one is about 3.5 cm across and the smaller one about 3 cm, so I estimate about 25 g together. They look like stuffed or plain mushrooms, and I'll take about 100 kcal per 100 g.

Roasted sweet potato is about 120 kcal per 100 g. I see no visible oil pooling, so I'm not counting any added fat as a separate item.

